OL,3,GNEWSACollege expands education courses
OL,4,Awith new centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull College says it is expanding its
OL,7,Fhigher education and degree courses
OL,8,Fwith a new dedicated centre.
OL,10,FHigher Hull, a new facility situated on
OL,11,Fthe college's city centre campus, has
OL,12,Fbeen designed to make study more
OL,13,Faccessible for people progressing from
OL,14,Fcollege, adults returning to learning
OL,15,Fand those seeking a change in career.
OL,17,FThe expansion will span Levels 4 to 7,
OL,18,Ffrom higher national qualifications and
OL,19,Ffoundation degrees to honours degrees
OL,20,Fand postgraduate study.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
