OL,3,GNEWSACollege expands education courses
OL,4,Awith new centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FDebra Gray CBE, principal and chief
OL,7,Fexecutive of Hull College, said:
OL,8,F"Talent is everywhere. Opportunity
OL,9,Fshould be, too."
